  "endpoint_domain": "Plan instances only, in both written directions, as in Current CA-R-1580. No endpoint numeric cardinalities are proposed.",
  "endpoint_permissions_required": [
    "CA-R-2511 effective Plan instance whitelist needs explicit outgoing IS_BLOCKED_BY to Plan and separate outgoing BLOCKS to Plan under CA-R-2462 and CA-R-2588; exact bounds must be sourced or decided separately.",
    "A Relation signature and HAS_INVERSE binding neither create facts nor grant the other direction. Do not add unverified max or min counts."
  ],
  "integration_gates": [
    "CA-D-471 currently requires storing direct BLOCKS on the prerequisite under relations.blocks; this directly conflicts with the new direct/derived choice. Reconcile serialization and existing Plan data as a separately reviewed source and migration change before adoption; do not silently reverse existing facts.",
    "CA-M-306 directs authors to express dependencies with BLOCKS; reconcile authoring direction. CA-E-504, CA-E-404, CA-E-622, CA-M-239 and CA-R-1592 consume BLOCKS semantics; retain derived views and review how assertions/observations are interpreted.",
    "CA-R-1026 and CA-R-1200 distinguish scheduling from Subject DEPENDS_ON; preserve that separation.",
    "Recheck all live source pins, frozen versioned references, exact preimages, selected effective MODEL permissions and all applicable source/consumer references before adoption; allocate new ID through governed workflow."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Latest direct/derived choice is an explicit human decision supplied by root, not a statement about current adopted authority.",
